{
  "name": "@abolishus/node",
  "version": "0.0.0",
  "private": true,
  "description": "The community node anyone can run with one command: a mirror of every block it holds, served by CID, and the fetch that pins every board object L1's checkpoints name, so far (docs/STATUS.md P4-5). Source-only.",
